# What `helm package` leaves out. The per-environment values files stay IN the
# package on purpose: Argo CD renders this chart with `-f values-<env>.yaml`
# (devops-infrastructure.md §1.2), and a package that does not carry them can
# only be rendered from the repository working tree.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
*.swp
*.bak
*.tmp
*.orig
*~
